+## 7.1 Durable pending-reconciliation inventory
+
+The guarded store entry `PlannerStoreV1::pending_dispatches_page` returns at
+most 256 unresolved claim projections and no execution capability. It validates
+claim/receipt ordering, original-grant binding and conclusive immutability, then
+rotates by claim sequence so a bounded product recovery owner can avoid oldest-
+claim starvation. A poisoned store cannot produce this authoritative view.
+
+Repository regressions launch a separate store-owner process, kill it without a
+normal destructor, abort after log sync but before in-memory publication, and
+verify that restore cannot replace a destination held by a live owner. These are
+source-level qualification cases; selected-target-host recovery remains false
+until an independently retained run receipt exists.
+
 ## 8. Failure semantics, recovery and rollback
